  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "İki koşul birlikte: `who == customer and when < day`. `<=` değil: o günkü arama sayılmaz.",
      "en": "Two conditions together: `who == customer and when < day`. Not `<=`: that day's call doesn't count."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Saymak için `sum(1 for who, when in calls if ...)`.",
      "en": "To count: `sum(1 for who, when in calls if ...)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef calls_as_of(labels, calls):\n    result = []\n    for customer, day in labels:\n        count = sum(1 for who, when in calls if who == customer and when < day)\n        result.append([customer, day, count])\n    return result\n\n\nlabels = [[\"C1\", \"2026-02-15\"], [\"C2\", \"2026-02-15\"], [\"C1\", \"2026-03-10\"]]\ncalls = [[\"C1\", \"2026-01-20\"], [\"C1\", \"2026-02-15\"], [\"C1\", \"2026-03-01\"], [\"C2\", \"2026-04-01\"]]\nfor row in calls_as_of(labels, calls):\n    print(row)\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef calls_as_of(labels, calls):\n    result = []\n    for customer, day in labels:\n        count = sum(1 for who, when in calls if who == customer and when < day)\n        result.append([customer, day, count])\n    return result\n\n\nlabels = [[\"C1\", \"2026-02-15\"], [\"C2\", \"2026-02-15\"], [\"C1\", \"2026-03-10\"]]\ncalls = [[\"C1\", \"2026-01-20\"], [\"C1\", \"2026-02-15\"], [\"C1\", \"2026-03-01\"], [\"C2\", \"2026-04-01\"]]\nfor row in calls_as_of(labels, calls):\n    print(row)\n```"
    }
